# Windsurf Config Lookup (deprecated)

> **Superseded by** `.cursor/rules/cursor-config-lookup.mdc`. Windsurf-specific paths are legacy; Cursor SSOT lives under `.cursor/`.

When a prompt references Windsurf configuration, resolve it through the Cursor lookup order in `cursor-config-lookup.mdc` unless the user explicitly asks about the Windsurf mirror (`.windsurf/mcp_config.json`, `~/.codeium/windsurf/`).
